<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.topke63.korrespond</id>
  <name>Korrespond</name>
  <summary>A simple IMAP mail client for Plasma</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>
  <developer id="io.github.topke63">
    <name>topke</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Korrespond is a simple mail client for KDE Plasma. It talks IMAP and SMTP directly and does not need Akonadi.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Yahoo, Gmail (Google sign-in) and any other IMAP provider, several accounts at once</li>
      <li>Conversations, local storage with import date, keep time and size limits</li>
      <li>Push mail (IMAP IDLE) and new-mail notifications</li>
      <li>Compose, reply and forward, with recipient autocomplete from your contacts</li>
      <li>Messages are shown without remote content and without JavaScript</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
